<h2>Specifications</h2>

<table>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Positioning resolution (X, Y)</td><td>20 &micro;m</td></tr>
<tr><td>Positioning resolution (Z)</td><td>8 &micro;m</td></tr>
<tr><td>Max viscosity</td><td>450 cP (higher with good wetting)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Particle size</td><td>1&ndash;70 &micro;m (best under 5 &micro;m)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Pattern input</td><td>AutoCAD&reg; DXF</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

